				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γανυμήδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			; epith. of Hades, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				24.257
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thrace</span>); ofhorses, <i>with
