			</span></i>): also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχαιτος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.60
			</span></i>.</div>
